---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Subscribe from '../components/Subscribe.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <section class="prose-wrap prose head">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Hi, we're Babet and Niels.</h1>
    <p>
      This is our journal from a trip through Indonesia. We post stories and photos as we go,
      usually from a phone and a café with questionable Wi-Fi.
    </p>
    <p>
      We set off from Ruurlo, took the train to Schiphol and flew via Abu Dhabi to Bali.
      Follow the <a href="/map/">route</a> to see where we've been so far.
    </p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose-wrap"><Subscribe /></div>
</Base>

<style>
  .head { padding: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem) 0 2rem; }
  .head h1 { margin: 0.4rem 0 1.2rem; }
</style>
